# PesaIQ — environment template.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in locally. NEVER commit `.env`.
#
# Parsing is entirely on-device and needs no keys. Sign-up and encrypted sync
# need the Supabase values below; the AI layer is an interface with no
# provider wired in.

# Supabase (sign-up with a mobile number, encrypted sync).
# The publishable key is meant to ship in the app: row-level security decides
# what it can reach. Never put a service-role/secret key, the SMS provider's
# token or the Send SMS hook secret here or anywhere in the app: those are
# Edge Function secrets, set in the Supabase dashboard.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_...

# Optional AI fallback (OFF by default, Stage 1 does not read this).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_PROVIDER=
# AI_API_KEY=
